From b9dc962cdac9bac1d0c9c7c3b9915969608c6393 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:36:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] chore(lock): resynchroniser les lockfiles avec package.json /
 resync lockfiles with package.json
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

FR : package.json demande vite ^8.0.16 et @vitejs/plugin-react ^6.0.2, mais
package-lock.json résolvait vite 7.3.5 / plugin-react 4.7.0 (+ arbre @babel/*)
et pnpm-lock.yaml référençait un plugin-react 6.0.2 absent de sa section
packages, avec des entrées orphelines 4.7.0. Régénérés avec pnpm 8.15.9
(format 6.0 conservé) et npm 10.9.4. L'état précédent est conservé tel quel
dans docs/history/lock-resync-20261023/before/. package.json est inchangé.

EN: package.json asks for vite ^8.0.16 and @vitejs/plugin-react ^6.0.2, but
package-lock.json resolved vite 7.3.5 / plugin-react 4.7.0 (+ @babel/* tree)
and pnpm-lock.yaml referenced a plugin-react 6.0.2 missing from its packages
section, with orphan 4.7.0 entries. Regenerated with pnpm 8.15.9 (6.0 format
kept) and npm 10.9.4. The previous state is kept as-is in
docs/history/lock-resync-20261023/before/. package.json is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 docs/history/lock-resync-20261023/README.md   |    7 +
 .../before/package-lock.json                  | 4402 +++++++++++++++++
 .../before/pnpm-lock.yaml                     | 2450 +++++++++
 package-lock.json                             | 1669 ++-----
 pnpm-lock.yaml                                |  817 ++-
 5 files changed, 7683 insertions(+), 1662 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 docs/history/lock-resync-20261023/README.md
 create mode 100644 docs/history/lock-resync-20261023/before/package-lock.json
 create mode 100644 docs/history/lock-resync-20261023/before/pnpm-lock.yaml

diff --git a/docs/history/lock-resync-20261023/README.md b/docs/history/lock-resync-20261023/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..07ac5c7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/history/lock-resync-20261023/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Resynchronisation des lockfiles — état AVANT / Lockfiles resync — state BEFORE
+
+FR : copie exacte de `package-lock.json` et `pnpm-lock.yaml` de `main` (eb3c940) avant resynchronisation avec `package.json`. Conservée volontairement (règle AGENTS.md : ne rien perdre). Ne pas nettoyer sans autorisation.
+EN: exact copy of `package-lock.json` and `pnpm-lock.yaml` from `main` (eb3c940) before resyncing with `package.json`. Kept on purpose (AGENTS.md rule: lose nothing). Do not clean up without permission.
+
+FR : régénérés avec pnpm 8.15.9 (`install --lockfile-only --fix-lockfile`, format `lockfileVersion: '6.0'` conservé) et npm 10.9.4 (`install --package-lock-only`). `package.json` est inchangé.
+EN: regenerated with pnpm 8.15.9 (`install --lockfile-only --fix-lockfile`, `lockfileVersion: '6.0'` format kept) and npm 10.9.4 (`install --package-lock-only`). `package.json` is unchanged.
